Shor's 9-qubit code. Encode |0> on qubits 0-8, apply a bit flip
(X = h p p h) to qubit 4, measure the syndromes Z3Z4 and Z4Z5 into
ancillas 9 and 10 (both read 1, pointing at qubit 4), correct qubit 4,
decode, and measure qubit 0, which is determinately 0.
